{"availability":"available","full":"JTruax/resonance-sound-frequencies","name":"resonance-sound-frequencies","description":"Resonance is an open source project with two main parts. 1: Free-to-use web app for sound therapy. 2: A knowledge base markdown file compiled on 29 academic resource documents on sound frequencies and their therapeutic effects. Use it with any LLM for your own project! ","category":"Productivity","language":"HTML","stars":73,"forks":15,"created":"2026-04-12T23:17:29Z","updated":"2026-10-03T22:55:50Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"https://jtruax.github.io/resonance-sound-frequencies/","topics":["binaural-beats","cymatics","frequencies","frequency-analysis","isochronic-tones","knowledge-base","markdown-language","sound-therapy","web-application","webapp"],"demo":"https://jtruax.github.io/resonance-sound-frequencies","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T19:32:31.013Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T19:32:31.013Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T19:32:31.013Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-05T19:07:00.841Z","stars":73,"forks":15},{"at":"2026-10-07T20:12:08.333Z","stars":73,"forks":15},{"at":"2026-10-09T22:03:55.611Z","stars":73,"forks":15},{"at":"2026-10-13T07:34:24.151Z","stars":73,"forks":15},{"at":"2026-10-15T19:32:31.013Z","stars":73,"forks":15}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["An interactive web app and open knowledge base for therapeutic sound frequencies, grounded in peer-reviewed research, ancient traditions, and cymatics."],"features":["40 Hz — Fibromyalgia impact scores fell 81% with 40 Hz body vibration in an open-label pilot of 19 women with no control group (Naghdi et al., 2015). In mice, 40 Hz light flicker cut amyloid-beta by roughly 40–67%…","50 Hz — Five minutes of 50 Hz vibration on the forearm raised nitric oxide 374% in healthy adults (Maloney-Hinds et al., 2009).","7.83 Hz — Earth's fundamental Schumann resonance. Isolation experiments by Wever suggested extremely-low-frequency fields can influence human circadian rhythms.","Shamanic drumming at 220–255 BPM (3.7–4.2 Hz) — with journey instructions, listeners reported dreamlike states far more often than with relaxation instructions (Gingras et al., 2014), and experienced practitioners…","OM chanting — a spectral analysis found 7–8 peaks, which the authors mapped to traditional chakra bands (Wani et al., 2021)."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/JTruax/resonance-sound-frequencies/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"2533066ee32eeb6c52dc41d72c217c142db650c1b3ce38c650f8f920cba932a3","extractedAt":"2026-10-05T19:07:01.052Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T19:32:31.169Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"An interactive web app and open knowledge base for therapeutic sound frequencies, grounded in peer-reviewed research, ancient traditions, and cymatics.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/JTruax/resonance-sound-frequencies/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"2533066ee32eeb6c52dc41d72c217c142db650c1b3ce38c650f8f920cba932a3","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/JTruax/resonance-sound-frequencies/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T19:32:31.169Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-03T22:55:50Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/JTruax/resonance-sound-frequencies/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T19:32:31.169Z","hash":"2533066ee32eeb6c52dc41d72c217c142db650c1b3ce38c650f8f920cba932a3","originalBytes":6690,"storedBytes":6690,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T19:32:31.013Z","demoHealth":{"url":"https://jtruax.github.io/resonance-sound-frequencies","attemptedAt":"2026-10-12T19:24:40.333Z","probeVersion":3,"status":"working","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T19:24:40.333Z","lastWorkingAt":"2026-10-12T19:24:40.333Z","target":"https://jtruax.github.io/resonance-sound-frequencies/","failureCount":0,"consecutiveTemporaryFailures":0,"nextCheckAt":"2026-10-19T19:24:40.333Z"},"pre